{title: Dekha Hai Pehli Baar}
{artist: S P Balsubramaniam Alka Yagnik Nadeem Shravan Saajan91}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am] [F],        Dekha hai pahli baar
[F] [G] [Am],        sajan ki aankho me pyar
[Am] [F],        Tab jaake aaya mere
[F] [G] [Am],        bechain dil ko karaar
[Am] [G],        Dilbar tujhe milne ko
[G] [Am],        kab se tha mai bekarar
[Am] [F],        Tab jaake aaya mere
[F] [G] [Am],        bechain dil ko karaar
[Am],        Palake jhukaau
[Dm],        tujhe dil me basaau
[C],        Abb bin tere mai
[G] [Am],        toh kahee chain naa paau
[Am],        Tu mera jigar hai tu meri nazar hai
[Am] [G],        Tu meri aarazu
[F] [Am],        tu mera hamsafar hai
[Am] [F],        Dekha hai pahli baar ....
[Am],        Meri adaaye
[Dm],        yeh meree javaanee
[C],        Bas tere liye hai
[G] [Am],        yeh meree jindagaanee
[Am],        Tu meri ghazal hai tu mera tarana
[Am] [G],        Aa teri dhadkano pe
[F] [Am],        likh du dil ka fasana
[Am] [F],        Dekha hai pahli baar
